{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1109475-ajaba-yava","id":1109475,"title":"Ajaba Yava","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-29T16:49:48-07:00","id":1109475,"title":"Ajaba Yava","content":"Rereading the Ajaba section of the CB20, and one thing just occurred to me. The Ajaba credit Black Tooth's knowledge of thier yava to why they were massacred at Ngorongoro Crater. My question is, would he have shared this information among the bastet in his army? How well known are the Ajaba Yava among Bastet or at least African Bastet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T06:37:07-07:00","id":1109727,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1109475-ajaba-yava#post1109475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Rereading the Ajaba section of the CB20, and one thing just occurred to me. The Ajaba credit Black Tooth's knowledge of thier yava to why they were massacred at Ngorongoro Crater. My question is, would he have shared this information among the bastet in his army? How well known are the Ajaba Yava among Bastet or at least African Bastet?</div> </div> </div> </div>Black Tooth's not the kind of guy to share anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T08:26:56-07:00","id":1109775,"title":"","content":"While that was my first impression, it would also make sense to as it would only negatively impact the Ajaba and make his army all the more dangerous to the hyenas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T12:21:58-07:00","id":1109862,"title":"","content":"I agree that Black Tooth would not have shared the Yava (though I honestly think that the Yava are unnecessary because they do not exist for any Fera except the Ajaba and the Bastet).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T22:37:05-07:00","id":1110762,"title":"","content":"Likely not; of he tipped his hand about the Ajaba's Yava, that likely would have made his allies nervous about THEIR Yava. And from a mythical angle - which is what hte Yava are - the more you spread it around the less powerful it gets, right? More than likely he simply kept that secret close to his chest and used its power to strengthen his own sorcery against the Ajaba. Nothing specific is named about the how's and whats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/612-the-cat-came-back","name":"The Cat Came Back","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar612_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"243"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T14:12:10-07:00","id":1111000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Cat Came Back</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1109475-ajaba-yava?p=1110762#post1110762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Likely not; of he tipped his hand about the Ajaba's Yava, that likely would have made his allies nervous about THEIR Yava. And from a mythical angle - which is what hte Yava are - the more you spread it around the less powerful it gets, right? More than likely he simply kept that secret close to his chest and used its power to strengthen his own sorcery against the Ajaba. Nothing specific is named about the how's and whats.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ok this is probably what everyone else was saying but sometimes things just don't click until its worded right. In my game I was trying to see just how well known the Yava was, and I was trying to come up with reasons why Black Tooth wouldn't have just spread it to the rest of his allies since he wants the Ajaba dead. I wanted it to be something with real reason besides &quot;MINE ALL MINE MY SECRET&quot;, and I like the way Cat Came Back worded it. Its about both not tipping your hand but also, you don't want the other Bastet tribes thinking this man will go just that far and use their own Yava's as well. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}